border-border bg-surface p-4`) titled `Cadeia da importa├º├úo`, with a one-line subtitle naming what the reader
is looking at (`importados ÔåÆ vinculados ÔåÆ enfileirados`, read from the server).

- Pending ÔåÆ `<LoadingState />`.
- Error, or settled with no data ÔåÆ an ERROR state. Use `<ErrorState onRetry={...} detail={...} />` with
